AWS region
VPC CIDR
Networking options
Step 3: Configure Networking
Attach:
VPN
Transit Gateway
VPC peering
Define inbound/outbound rules
Step 4: Deploy Application
Runtime Manager → Deploy
Choose:
CloudHub 2.0
Private Space
Pod size
Deploy
