✅ Dedicated infrastructure
✅ Kubernetes-based
✅ Better security & compliance
✅ Advanced networking control
✅ Auto-scaling
✅ High availability

3.6 Limitations of CloudHub 2.0
❌ More expensive
❌ More operational complexity
❌ Initial setup takes time

